' UC-AGA-02 — Assign User Access

@startuml
skinparam conditionStyle inside
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFEAA7
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #DFE6E9

|WAH Central Administrator|
start
:1.0 Access facility user access administration;

|WAHrden System|
:1.1 Verify administrative authority;
if (Authorized?) then (No [EF-01])
  :Present access-denied result;
  kill
else (Yes)
  :1.2 Present user & facility selection function;
endif

|WAH Central Administrator|
:2.0 Select target centralized user;

|WAHrden System|
if (User exists & available?) then (No [EF-02])
  :Present user context unavailable;
  kill
else (Yes)
  :2.1 Present current facility-specific access;
endif

|WAH Central Administrator|
:2.2 Select facility and choose action\n(Establish [AF-01], Modify [AF-02], or Revoke [AF-03]);

|WAHrden System|
if (Facility context available?) then (No [EF-02])
  :Present facility unavailable result;
  kill
else (Yes)
  :3.0 Validate proposed access change;
  if (Change valid and within governance rules?) then (No [EF-03])
    :Present validation issues & prompt correction;
    kill
  else (Yes)
    :Present validated access change for review;
  endif
endif

|WAH Central Administrator|
if (Confirm access change?) then (No / Cancel [EF-04])
  :Cancel action;
  kill
else (Yes [3.1])
  :Confirm access assignment/change;
endif

|WAHrden System|
:4.0 Apply facility access change;
if (Processing successful?) then (No [EF-05])
  :Present access-change processing failure;
  kill
else (Yes)
  |Database / Audit|
  :4.1 Record access change & audit trail;
  
  |WAHrden System|
  :4.2 Present resulting facility-specific access;
endif

|WAH Central Administrator|
:Review resulting access assignment;
stop
@enduml
